ial content.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Modi-Putin meeting at SCO: Can India-Russia ties hold?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:23241e079ab1e09f703d11216435e9852d0f7bbc938947db38f07cafd46076fb</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:18:18Z</updated><published>2026-08-31T12:02:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/modi-putin-meeting-at-sco-can-india-russia-ties-hold/a-78575121--cdcdfb671d17.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/modi-putin-meeting-at-sco-can-india-russia-ties-hold/a-78575121?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Indian PM Modi and Russian President Putin are at the SCO summit in Bishkek as Moscow and New Delhi face rising tensions with Washington — Russia over war-related sanctions, and India over its energy and trade choices.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Nepal floods: A major test for PM Balen's government</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f6fd7a0522d9764b92ba9bdc96d8f876fa19890c49f112f8073cc9798dea1ce3</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:18:21Z</updated><published>2026-08-31T11:34:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/nepal-floods-a-major-test-for-pm-balen-s-government/a-78574227--06041352f7bd.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/nepal-floods-a-major-test-for-pm-balen-s-government/a-78574227?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A year after Gen Z-led protests swept Prime Minister Balendra "Balen" Shah to power, deadly floods are testing his government's ability to manage a national crisis.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>With multilateralism in decline, what's next for the world?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a81d8ffc03856ab4acaad6763dddaa704ba9629e65fec8283543140779df579f</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:18:24Z</updated><published>2026-08-31T11:13:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/with-multilateralism-in-decline-what-s-next-for-the-world/a-78555977--8df5725f7fb9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/with-multilateralism-in-decline-what-s-next-for-the-world/a-78555977?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The global political architecture is shifting, partly as a result of the actions of US President Donald Trump. As nations search for a new world order, some may gain influence and power, while others have much to lose.</summary><category term="TOP STORIES" /></entry><entry><title>Inside the sea cucumber smuggling boom</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f3d3c09316d40f86da8db05f229a41e1888fdd1e826a3427168f63e03f1bcaa7</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:18:27Z</updated><published>2026-08-31T10:50:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/inside-the-sea-cucumber-smuggling-boom/a-78005662--0b2701be2732.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/inside-the-sea-cucumber-smuggling-boom/a-78005662?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A quiet multimillion‑dollar black market is exploding across the Indian Ocean, driven by one unlikely animal: the sea cucumber.</summary><category term="Environment" /></entry><entry><title>Nepal flood: Death toll crosses 900, thousands still missing</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:3ed0069ed20f892a694a15252ced9e26650bc4261aff98f9108f976a1a4cad94</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:18:30Z</updated><published>2026-08-31T07:09:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/nepal-flood-death-toll-crosses-900-thousands-still-missing/a-78568505--ecc2324a1555.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/nepal-flood-death-toll-crosses-900-thousands-still-missing/a-78568505?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Rescue teams are racing to reach stranded people, even as nearly 4,800 remain missing. Meanwhile, mass burials have sparked controversy in Nepal.</summary><category term="News" />